  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "$100 Visa Gift card for booking between now and April 5th. <br>Beach of Dreams 30A. <br>Stunning Coastal Retreat in Grande Pointe – Inlet Beach<br><br>Welcome to your perfect Inlet Beach getaway. This beautifully appointed, fully furnished 5-bedroom, 3.5-bath coastal home is located in the highly desirable Grande Pointe community, offering the ideal blend of comfort, style, and location for an unforgettable vacation. Home comes equipped with a 6-seater golf cart to help you get around! We also offer 4 bikes for your riding adventures!<br><br>Thoughtfully designed with raised ceilings, rich wood floors, an open-concept layout, and charming shiplap accents, the home feels both elegant and relaxed. <br><br>The gourmet kitchen is fully equipped for vacation dining, featuring a gas cooktop, built-in wall oven, and ample space to gather with family and friends. The kitchen opens up to the living area with two sofas to spread out on! off the living area is a back patio with a propane grill and a green egg grill. <br><br>The spacious primary suite is conveniently located on the main level, providing privacy and easy access to the main living areas. The primary suite as a en-suite bath with double vanities and a stand alone shower. Guest also have access to a large walk in closet - big enough for a portable crib. <br><br>Upstairs, you will find a second large living area with a flat screen tv, ample seating, board games and a octagon gaming table. This offers a perfect retreat for kids or teens and is ideal for movie nights, game nights, or relaxing after a day at the beach.<br><br>Four generously sized guest bedrooms comfortably accommodate larger groups, including two bedrooms connected by a stylish Jack-and-Jill bathroom. The first guest room has a king bed. The second guest room has a queen bed. The third guest room has two twin beds. The fourth guest room has twin over twin bunks with a twin trundle. <br><br>Located on scenic Lake Powell, Grande Pointe is a waterfront community just minutes from the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of 30A. Guests enjoy access to a community pool, clubhouse, and private dock—perfect for paddleboarding, kayaking, and enjoying sunsets on the lake. Discover a destination where coastal charm meets effortless convenience. <br><br>The area’s natural beauty can be seen at Inlet Beach, Rosemary Beach, and Carillon Beach, offering pristine white sand, emerald waters, and a relaxed coastal atmosphere ideal for visitors seeking both tranquility and adventure. Just a 15-minute walk to the beach, and right around the corner is 30A Avenue Shops & Restaurants which provides a vibrant hub of dining, shopping, and entertainment, making it easy to enjoy everything from casual seaside meals to upscale cuisine without ever needing to drive. This unique combination of scenic beaches and walkable amenities makes the area an exceptional choice for tourists looking to experience the best of Florida’s Emerald Coast.<br><br>Whether you are planning a family vacation, a friends’ getaway, or a longer coastal escape, this Grande Pointe retreat offers space, amenities, and a prime location to make your stay truly exceptional.<br><br>Please note guest must sign a waiver to access lock box for golf cart keys.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
